00969/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e有朋自远方来·其四\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false,\"without_border\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"3882","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"NPC对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"child_ids\":{\"4cf2vhylew3T1710863944349\":[\"b7yzrqsoocoT1713364457523\"],\"89kln2ghxrpT1713364420713\":[\"b7yzrqsoocoT1713364457523\"],\"8gfxrw8wla9T1710863939170\":[\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\",\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\",\"4cf2vhylew3T1710863944349\",\"89kln2ghxrpT1713364420713\"],\"ae5gxvc1g35T1713364530329\":[\"oztz1dmc0wT1713364543397\"],\"b7yzrqsoocoT1713364457523\":[\"jn18v8dekrbT1713364494973\"],\"fuw3tvdzigqT1713364513691\":[\"ae5gxvc1g35T1713364530329\"],\"jn18v8dekrbT1713364494973\":[\"fuw3tvdzigqT1713364513691\"],\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\":[\"b7yzrqsoocoT1713364457523\"],\"oztz1dmc0wT1713364543397\":[],\"qbcz896k00hT1713364370217\":[\"b7yzrqsoocoT1713364457523\"],\"qlu405hfgvfT1713364369092\":[\"b7yzrqsoocoT1713364457523\"],\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\":[\"qlu405hfgvfT1713364369092\",\"qbcz896k00hT1713364370217\"]},\"contents\":{\"4cf2vhylew3T1710863944349\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e啊，那位啊。那是我的内人。是蒙德嫁过来的。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e古代童谣道，「一半嫁作酒乡妇，一半到海不复归。」\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e我是不是帮璃月扳回了一城？哈哈哈。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e戈黛特她很厉害的。分析一些小细节就能猜出人的来历。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【那边不是璃月人的那位是？】\"},\"89kln2ghxrpT1713364420713\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e没事没事，多来打扰啊。望舒客栈永远欢迎您。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【不打扰了。】\"},\"8gfxrw8wla9T1710863939170\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e您好您好。我是望舒客栈掌柜淮安。吃饭还是住店啊？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【开场白】\"},\"ae5gxvc1g35T1713364530329\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e哟，旅行者，今年算是开了个好头呀。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【开场白】\"},\"b7yzrqsoocoT1713364457523\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003chr\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e【逐月节期间】\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"\"},\"fuw3tvdzigqT1713364513691\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003chr\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e【第四次海灯节（2024）期间】\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"\"},\"jn18v8dekrbT1713364494973\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e您好您好。我是望舒客栈掌柜淮安。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e望舒客栈可是登高赏月的好地方，顶层的视野极佳，空中皎月和周边美景一览无余。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【开场白】\"},\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e【胜利】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e真不错！你的牌技和你的身手一样了得！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: start\\\"\u003e【失败】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e呼…我只是险胜，下次我就未必有这么走运了！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/04/17/72954525/cc2a44c2e85425afbbd461e49fe0875d_3421696989410691929.png\",\"option\":\"【冒险挑战】——进行七圣召唤对局【牌手九级解锁】\"},\"oztz1dmc0wT1713364543397\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003chr\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"\"},\"qbcz896k00hT1713364370217\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e狗，狗当然叫旺财了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e它挺懂事的，又爱干净，不会给客人添麻烦的。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【关于这狗…】\"},\"qlu405hfgvfT1713364369092\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e传闻，什么传闻？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e如果是关于我们望舒客栈的诽谤谣言，那全部都不可信。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e如果是说有什么有趣的事情。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e最近璃月港的愚人众变多了。山雨欲来啊。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e您倒是有什么有意思的事情能和我分享分享的？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【关于传闻…】\"},\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\":{\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e托您关照，生意一直都还行。日子过得去。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e哈哈哈。又到了该活络起来的时候了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【最近生意如何？】\"}},\"root_id\":\"8gfxrw8wla9T1710863939170\"}\n","style":""}],"id":"3885","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false}],"filter_values":{},"menu_id":"0","menu_name":"","version":"1713372452","langs":[],"template_layout":{"tab":[{"tab_id":"69","tab_name":"页签1","module_group":[{"module_group_id":"691","layout":"l2r1","module":[{"id":"1207","pos":"left"},{"id":"1208","pos":"right"},{"id":"3882","pos":"banner"}],"name":"基本资料","repeated":false,"parent_group_id":"0"},{"module_group_id":"692","layout":"l1r1","module":[{"id":"1209","pos":"banner"}],"name":"","repeated":true,"parent_group_id":"0"},{"module_group_id":"693